subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [subtrack] <OPTIONS>          Manage subscription services from your terminal
  add <OPTIONS>                 Add a subscription
  analytics <OPTIONS>           Show detailed subscription analytics
  archive <OPTIONS>             Archive a subscription (set status to archived)
  audit <OPTIONS>               View and manage the audit log
  backup <OPTIONS>              Backup database (gzip compressed)
  budget <OPTIONS>              Show spending vs budget and detect budget overruns
  bulk <OPTIONS>                Bulk operations on subscriptions
  calendar <OPTIONS>            Show a monthly calendar with billing days marked
  cancel <OPTIONS>              Cancel a subscription with a guided checklist
  changes <OPTIONS>             Show subscription changes
  check <OPTIONS>               Check subscription data integrity
  cleanup <OPTIONS>             Run all maintenance tasks (integrity check, VACUUM, prune audit/tags)
  clone <OPTIONS>               Clone an existing subscription
  compare <OPTIONS>             Compare spending between current and previous period
  config <OPTIONS>              Manage configuration
  currency <OPTIONS>            List supported currencies
  dedupe <OPTIONS>              Detect duplicate subscriptions by name similarity
  delete <OPTIONS>              Delete subscriptions
  edit <OPTIONS>                Edit a subscription
  export <OPTIONS>              Export subscriptions
  forecast <OPTIONS>            Show spending forecast and what-if scenarios
  history <OPTIONS>             Show price change history for a subscription
  import <OPTIONS>              Import subscriptions from CSV
  list <OPTIONS>                List all subscriptions
  maintenance <OPTIONS>         Run database maintenance (VACUUM, integrity check)
  mcp <OPTIONS>                 Start MCP server for AI agent integration (stdio transport)
  notify <OPTIONS>              Send desktop notification for upcoming bills
  optimize <OPTIONS>            Analyze subscriptions and suggest cost optimizations
  pause <OPTIONS>               Pause subscriptions
  payment <OPTIONS>             Show payment totals
  profile <OPTIONS>             Manage filter profiles
  receipt <OPTIONS>             Import subscription candidates from a receipt file
  renew <OPTIONS>               Renew a subscription
  report <OPTIONS>              Show a yearly subscription report
  restore <OPTIONS>             Restore database from a backup
  resume <OPTIONS>              Resume paused or cancelled subscriptions
  review <OPTIONS>              Review upcoming renewals, bills, and trials
  search <OPTIONS>              Search subscriptions by name, notes, or tags
  stats <OPTIONS>               Show database statistics
  suggest <OPTIONS>             Manage subscription suggestions
  summary <OPTIONS>             Show subscription summary statistics
  tag <OPTIONS>                 Manage tags
  tags <OPTIONS>                Filter subscriptions by tags (AND logic)
  template <OPTIONS>            Manage subscription templates
  timeline <OPTIONS>            Show monthly spending timeline with bar chart
  trial <OPTIONS>               Manage free trials
  unarchive <OPTIONS>           Unarchive a subscription (set status back to active)
  upcoming <OPTIONS>            Show upcoming bills within a number of days
  usage <OPTIONS>               Track LLM API usage costs
  yearly <OPTIONS>              Show annual subscription spending

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack --help
  subtrack add --help
  subtrack analytics --help
  subtrack archive --help
  subtrack audit --help
